  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1733_love-story.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A little girl had two apples. Her mother asked, “Can you give me one?”",
    "The girl looked at her mother and took a bite out of each apple. Her mother felt sad.",
    "But after tasting them, the girl said, “This one is sweet. It’s for you, Mom!”"
  ],
  "english_full": "A little girl had two apples. Her mother asked, “Can you give me one?”\n\nThe girl looked at her mother and took a bite out of each apple. Her mother felt sad.\n\nBut after tasting them, the girl said, “This one is sweet. It’s for you, Mom!”",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Де́вочка имела дво́йку я́блок. Ма́ма спро́сила: «Да́й мне о́дно?»",
    "Де́вочка посмот́рела на ма́му и уку́сила ка́ждое я́блоко. Ма́ма почувствова́ла гру́сть.",
    "Но по́сле дегуста́ции их де́вочка ска́зала: «Э́то сла́дкое. Оно́ для тебя́, Ма́ма!»"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Dévochka iméla dvoyúku yáblok. Máma sprósila: «Dái mne ódno?»",
    "Dévochka posmot́rela na mámu i ukúsila kázhdoe yábloko. Máma pochuvstvovála grústʹ.",
    "No posle degústatsii ikh dévochka skazála: «Éto sladkoe. Onó dlya tebá, Máma!»"
  ],
